ETH to each first. Each bridge delivers about 0.000833 ETH after fees.\n\n| # | Leg | In | Expected out | Cost (USD) |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | Swap ETH → WBTC on Ethereum | 0.1 ETH | 495,000 sats WBTC | 3.90 |\n| 2 | Bridge ETH, Ethereum → Robinhood Chain (for fees) | 0.001 ETH | ~0.000833 ETH | 1.40 |\n| 3 | Bridge ETH, Ethereum → Arbitrum (for fees) | 0.001 ETH | ~0.000833 ETH | 1.40 |\n| 4 | Bridge WBTC, Ethereum → Robinhood Chain | 247,500 sats | 246,666 sats | 1.4004 |\n| 5 | Bridge WBTC, Ethereum → Arbitrum | 247,500 sats | 246,666 sats | 1.4004 |\n| 6 | Swap WBTC → ETH on Robinhood Chain | 246,666 sats | ~0.0492332 ETH | 0.36 |\n| 7 | Swap WBTC → USDC on Arbitrum | 246,666 sats | ~147.6996 USDC | 0.36 |\n\n- **Total cost:** $10.2208, under your $15.00 policy limit.\n- **Ethereum wallet:** keeps about 0.0465 ETH for gas (estimated).\n- **Arbitrum route:** sending WBTC across and swapping there costs about $3.16, including the gas bridge. Swapping to USDC on Ethereum and bridging the USDC would cost about $6.70.\n- **Bridge timing:** each bridge takes about 60 seconds. I'll run one leg at a time and check each wallet's balance before the next step.\n\nDo you want me to go ahead? You can also refuse, or set a lower cost cap."}]},{"role":"user","sequence":22,"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Yes, go ahead with that plan."}]},{"role":"assistant","sequence":23,"content":[{"type":"toolCall","name":"mcp__ai_sdk_harness_tools_execute_leg","arguments":{"quote_id":"q_1","approval_id":"appr_9"},"id":"toolu_01RU66o82rX5AeeLB1EihmSu"}]},{"role":"tool","sequence":24,"content":[{"type":"toolResult","text":"{\"tx_id\":\"tx_10\"}","toolCallId":"toolu_01RU66o82rX5AeeLB1EihmSu","toolName":"mcp__ai_sdk_harness_tools_execute_leg","isError":false}]},{"role":"assistant","sequence":25,"content":[{"type":"toolCall","name":"mcp__ai_sdk_harness_tools_tx_status","arguments":{"tx_id":"tx_10"},"id":"toolu_01MvH2yYmg2dQGRqoX31w4R2"}]},{"role":"tool","sequence":26,"content":[{"type":"t