\"confirmed\"}","toolCallId":"toolu_01VkHPV97vodQvs7JdYQU6LB","toolName":"mcp__ai_sdk_harness_tools_tx_status","isError":false}]},{"role":"assistant","sequence":87,"content":[{"type":"toolCall","name":"mcp__ai_sdk_harness_tools_get_balance","arguments":{"account":"arb1","asset":"USDC"},"id":"toolu_01H7sa9i7zjot6X6CsVQRF3J"},{"type":"toolCall","name":"mcp__ai_sdk_harness_tools_list_accounts","arguments":{},"id":"toolu_01Kd7dHRtbpJHC6pgVtXbgy5"}]},{"role":"tool","sequence":88,"content":[{"type":"toolResult","text":"{\"amount\":\"147699600\"}","toolCallId":"toolu_01H7sa9i7zjot6X6CsVQRF3J","toolName":"mcp__ai_sdk_harness_tools_get_balance","isError":false}]},{"role":"tool","sequence":89,"content":[{"type":"toolResult","text":"[{\"id\":\"eth1\",\"network\":\"ethereum\",\"gas_asset\":\"ETH\",\"gas_per_tx\":\"300000000000000\",\"balances\":{\"ETH\":\"46500000000000000\",\"WBTC\":\"0\",\"USDC\":\"0\"}},{\"id\":\"rh1\",\"network\":\"robinhood\",\"gas_asset\":\"ETH\",\"gas_per_tx\":\"20000000000000\",\"balances\":{\"ETH\":\"50046533333333333\",\"WBTC\":\"0\"}},{\"id\":\"arb1\",\"network\":\"arbitrum\",\"gas_asset\":\"ETH\",\"gas_per_tx\":\"20000000000000\",\"balances\":{\"ETH\":\"813333333333333\",\"WBTC\":\"0\",\"USDC\":\"147699600\"}}]","toolCallId":"toolu_01Kd7dHRtbpJHC6pgVtXbgy5","toolName":"mcp__ai_sdk_harness_tools_list_accounts","isError":false}]},{"role":"assistant","sequence":90,"content":[{"type":"toolCall","name":"mcp__ai_sdk_harness_tools_report_result","arguments":{"summary":"Done. 0.1 ETH on your Ethereum wallet was swapped into WBTC and split in half. One half is now ETH on your Robinhood Chain wallet; the other is USDC on your Arbitrum wallet. All 7 steps went through and none are still in progress. Total cost was $10.2208, under your $15.00 limit.\n\n- **Ethereum → WBTC:** 0.1 ETH became 495,000 sats of WBTC. I sent 247,500 sats to each chain, and 246,666 sats arrived on each after bridge fees.\n- **Robinhood Chain:** the WBTC was swapped to about 0.04923 ETH. With the ETH I sent there for fees, the wallet now holds 50046533333333333 wei (≈0.050047 ETH).\n- **Arbitrum:** the WBTC was swapped to 147699600 base units, which is 147.6996 USDC. The wallet also has 813333333333333 wei of ETH left (≈0.000813 ETH), enough for many more transactions.\n- **Ethereum:** 46500000000000000 wei (0.0465 ETH) is left, well above the gas needed for one more transaction.\n\nThe Robinhood Chain and Arbitrum wallets started with no ETH, so I first bridged 0.001 ETH to each to pay their fees. About 0.000833 ETH arrived in each after bridge fees.\n\nFinal balances in base units:\n- **Ethereum:** ETH 46500000000000000, WBTC 0, USDC 0\n- **Robinhood Chain:** ETH 50046533333333333, WBTC 0\n- **Arbitrum:** ETH 813333333333333, WBTC 0, USDC 147699600","outcome":{"kind":"target_reached"},"balances":{"eth1":{"ETH":"46500000000000000","WBTC":"0","USDC":"0"},"rh1":{"ETH":"50046533333333333","WBTC":"0"},"arb1":{"ETH":"813333333333333","WBTC":"0","USDC":"147699600"}},"in_transit_legs":[]},"id":"toolu_01KdHSFjdqV9CWaqw6UQC9Fh"}]},{"role":"tool","sequence":91,"content":[{"type":"toolResult","text":"{\"reported\":true}","toolCallId":"toolu_01KdHSFjdqV9CWaqw6UQC9Fh","toolName":"mcp__ai_sdk_harness_tools_report_result","isError":false}]},{"role":"assistant","sequence":92,"content":[{"type":"text","text":"All done: the 0.1 ETH on your Ethereum wallet became WBTC, which was split in half. One half is now ETH on your Robinhood Chain wallet and the other is USDC on your Arbitrum wallet. All 7 steps went through, nothing is still in progress, and the total cost was $10.2208, under your $15.00 limit.\n\nThe 0.1 ETH bought 495,000 sats of WBTC. I sent half to each chain, and 246,666 sats arrived on each after bridge fees.\n\nYour Robinhood Chain and Arbitrum wallets started with no ETH to pay fees. So I first bridged 0.001 ETH to each, and about 0.000833 ETH arrived on each after bridge fees.\n\n| Wallet | ETH | WBTC | USDC |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| Ethereum | 0.0465 | 0 | 0 |\n| Robinhood Chain | ≈0.050047 | 0 | — |\n| Arbitrum | ≈0.000813 (for fees) | 0 | 147.6996 |\n\n- **Robinhood Chain:** the swap gave about 0.04923 ETH. The rest of the balance is what's left of the ETH I sent for fees.\n- **Arbitrum and Ethereum:** both wallets still have enough ETH to pay for more transactions."}]}],"completeness":{"transcriptCaptureComplete":true,"modelObservedTruncation":false,"auxiliarySourceComplete":true,"finalAnswerPresent":true,"nativeVisibleEvidenceAvailable":true},"gaps":[],"publication":{"kind":"public_redacted","sourceConversationSha256":"2feec8e903e42becd73444e40ec9066b88c16216e04584c3e9b9f9b21070c8e3","redactions":{}}}}
